# .npmignore -- the second filter on what reaches the tarball.
#
# READ THIS BEFORE ADDING A RULE HERE.
#
# `files` in package.json is an allowlist, and npm gives it precedence: a path
# inside a directory named in `files` CANNOT be excluded from here. Verified,
# not assumed -- a `*.log` rule in this file did not stop
# loops/example-store/state/whiffs.log from packing, because `loops/` is
# allowlisted.
#
# So the two files divide up like this, and a rule in the wrong one is silently
# a no-op:
#
#   to drop a whole tree        remove it from `files` in package.json
#   to drop something npm adds  on its own initiative, or that could appear
#                               inside an allowlisted tree on someone else's
#                               machine (editor droppings, build artifacts,
#                               a stray .tgz) -- here
#
# Either way, the only real check is the output, not the intent:
#
#   npm pack --dry-run
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Not in `files`, restated so the reason survives
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# These are already excluded by the allowlist. They are named here so that
# widening `files` later does not quietly pull them in, and so the reason is
# written down somewhere.
#
# evals/ is the fixture store and the scorers that grade a model against it.
# It is how you check a change to the retrieval engine -- work you do from a
# clone with the git history in front of you, not from node_modules. Cloning
# gets you all of it.
evals/
CONTRIBUTING.md
.github/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Generated or machine-local, and could appear inside an allowlisted tree
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.egg-info/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Editor, OS and backup droppings
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
._*
*.swp
*~
*.bak
*.orig
*.rej
.idea/
.vscode/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Packaging and VCS housekeeping
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.git/
.gitattributes
node_modules/
*.tgz
package-lock.json
npm-debug.log*
.npmrc
